@wilstracke The are already targetting NSW "The campaign to pass the first prolife bill in Australian history is ramping up with our team preparing for a huge public rally on June 2nd, the day before the bill goes to a vote.

This week we letterboxed the seat of Labor MP Warren Kirby, began our meetings with NSW MPs, gave a presentation at ACU North Sydney and spoke to an audience of over 150 people at Padre Pio Catholic Church in Glenmore Park.

Next week will be even bigger with a live podcast hosted by C3 Church in Sydney, more letterboxing and meetings.
